  "title": {
   "en": "Seijo-sama no Gyaku Harem kara Abureta Kishi-sama ni Netsuretsu ni Kyuuaisareteiru Ken"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "关于我被跳出圣女大人逆后宫的骑士大人热烈求爱这件事 聖女様の逆ハーレムからあぶれた騎士様に熱烈に求愛されている件"
   },
   {
    "ja-ro": "Seijo-sama no Gyaku Harem kara Abureta Kishi-sama ni Netsuretsu ni Kyuuaisareteiru Ken"
   },
   {
    "en": "The Knight Who Failed to Win the Saintess' Love Poured All His Feelings Into Me"
   },
   {
    "zh": "关于我被跳出圣女大人逆后宫的骑士大人热烈求爱这件事"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "“Even Heroes… Fall in Love.”\nYes, that’s normal.\nBut… “Being held responsible for taking his virginity? I never saw that coming!”\n\nThat day was a disaster for Rachel.\nShe lost her lover to her younger sister, her family sided with the sister, and even decided she would inherit the family name.\n\nRachel, who had worked tirelessly for years and given everything to support her poor family, was cast aside without a second thought.\n\nAt the peak of her despair, she drowned herself in alcohol at a modest tavern… and there, she met Alfred—\nOne of the heroes who had saved the world, now drinking in sorrow because he had been “kicked out of the Saintess’s harem” for being too conservative!\n\nThey talked, shared their sorrows… and with the help of alcohol, lost control of their emotions.\n\nWhen Rachel opened her eyes the next morning…\n“Let’s go file the marriage paperwork.”\n“Huh!?”"
  },
